{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26598","headline":"送源中丞赴新罗 · 姚合","name":"送源中丞赴新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤墀赐对使殊方，官重霜台紫绶光。\n玉节在船清海怪，金函开诏拜夷王。\n云晴渐觉山川异，风便那知道路长。\n谁得似君将雨露，海东万里洒扶桑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}